translation.coach.findingTypes.argueLoop.label	Disagreement loops
translation.coach.findingTypes.argueLoop.recommendation	When a back-and-forth stalls, restate the requirements from scratch instead of arguing.
translation.coach.findingTypes.blockedDomainLoop.label	Blocked domain retries
translation.coach.findingTypes.blockedDomainLoop.recommendation	Allowlist the domains Devin needs, or tell it upfront what's unreachable.
translation.coach.findingTypes.brokenOrStaleDrs.label	Broken or stale environment setup
translation.coach.findingTypes.brokenOrStaleDrs.recommendation	Refresh your repo's snapshot/setup so Devin doesn't redo environment setup each session.
translation.coach.findingTypes.contextDumpNoTask.label	Context without a task
translation.coach.findingTypes.contextDumpNoTask.recommendation	State what Devin should actually do when pasting threads or docs.
translation.coach.findingTypes.contradictoryPrompt.label	Contradictory requirements
translation.coach.findingTypes.contradictoryPrompt.recommendation	Double-check prompts for conflicting requirements before sending.
translation.coach.findingTypes.emotionalVenting.label	Venting without instruction
translation.coach.findingTypes.emotionalVenting.recommendation	Pair frustration with a concrete instruction so Devin knows how to correct course.
translation.coach.findingTypes.flakyCiLoop.label	Flaky CI loops
translation.coach.findingTypes.flakyCiLoop.recommendation	Tell Devin which CI failures are flaky/unrelated so it doesn't loop on them.
translation.coach.findingTypes.largePr.label	Oversized PRs
translation.coach.findingTypes.largePr.recommendation	Split large changes into smaller stacked PRs and sessions — they review and merge faster.
translation.coach.findingTypes.mergeConflictRot.label	Stale branch conflicts
translation.coach.findingTypes.mergeConflictRot.recommendation	Merge or close long-lived PRs before they rot into conflict-resolution work.
translation.coach.findingTypes.misleadingKnowledge.label	Outdated knowledge
translation.coach.findingTypes.misleadingKnowledge.recommendation	Review and prune knowledge notes that no longer match your codebase.
translation.coach.findingTypes.missingEnvContext.label	Missing environment context
translation.coach.findingTypes.missingEnvContext.recommendation	Specify the branch, environment, and service so Devin works on the right target.
translation.coach.findingTypes.multitaskingInSession.label	Multiple tasks in one session
translation.coach.findingTypes.multitaskingInSession.recommendation	Run unrelated tasks as separate sessions so each keeps full context.
translation.coach.findingTypes.narrowUsage.label	Narrow usage
translation.coach.findingTypes.narrowUsage.recommendation	Try Devin on more kinds of work — reviews, migrations, tests — to get more value.
translation.coach.findingTypes.noPlanBeforeImpl.description	The prompt asks Devin to implement something that should be planned out first. Planning first aligns you and Devin on the spec so ACUs aren't wasted on unwanted implementation.
translation.coach.findingTypes.noPlanBeforeImpl.label	No plan before implementation
translation.coach.findingTypes.noPlanBeforeImpl.recommendation	Ask Devin to confirm a plan before writing code to avoid mid-session rework.
translation.coach.findingTypes.noRepoSpecified.label	No repository specified
translation.coach.findingTypes.noRepoSpecified.recommendation	Name the repository in your initial prompt so Devin starts in the right place.
translation.coach.findingTypes.nonWorkUsage.description	The prompt is not related to work. Devin suggests clearing the prompt so usage is not spent on something that doesn't drive business value.
translation.coach.findingTypes.nonWorkUsage.label	Non-work usage
translation.coach.findingTypes.nonWorkUsage.recommendation	Keep sessions focused on engineering work so your usage goes toward shipping.
translation.coach.findingTypes.repeatedTaskNoSkill.label	Repeated tasks without a skill
translation.coach.findingTypes.repeatedTaskNoSkill.recommendation	Turn tasks you run repeatedly into a skill or playbook so Devin nails them first try.
translation.coach.findingTypes.screenshotOnlyBug.label	Screenshot-only bug reports
translation.coach.findingTypes.screenshotOnlyBug.recommendation	Include reproduction steps and context with bug reports, not just a screenshot.
translation.coach.findingTypes.sessionAbandonment.label	Abandoned sessions
translation.coach.findingTypes.sessionAbandonment.recommendation	Wrap up or terminate sessions instead of leaving Devin waiting on input.
translation.coach.findingTypes.unsavedRepeatedCorrection.label	Repeated unsaved corrections
translation.coach.findingTypes.unsavedRepeatedCorrection.recommendation	When you correct Devin twice with the same fact, save it as knowledge or a skill.
