translation.coachPrecheck.setting.modeWarningAndModal	Warning and confirmation
translation.coachPrecheck.setting.modeWarningAndModalDescription	Show the inline warning and ask for confirmation before sending
translation.coachPrecheck.setting.modeWarningOnly	Warning only
