translation.coachPrecheck.noPlanBeforeImpl.caption	Consider asking Devin for a plan before implementing
translation.coachPrecheck.noPlanBeforeImpl.label	No plan before implementation
translation.coachPrecheck.noPlanBeforeImpl.recommendation	Ask Devin to confirm a plan before writing code to avoid mid-session rework
translation.coachPrecheck.nonWorkUsage.caption	Your prompt seems irrelevant to work use-cases
translation.coachPrecheck.nonWorkUsage.label	Non-work usage
translation.coachPrecheck.nonWorkUsage.recommendation	Keep sessions focused on engineering work so your usage goes toward delivering results
translation.coachPrecheck.overkillDevinMode.caption	Ultra may be more than this task needs
translation.coachPrecheck.overkillDevinMode.description	A heavyweight model (e.g. Ultra) is selected for a task that a lighter model class can handle. Devin suggests downgrading the selected model class to save ACUs.
translation.coachPrecheck.overkillDevinMode.label	Heavyweight mode
translation.coachPrecheck.overkillDevinMode.recommendation	Switch to a lighter mode for small, simple tasks
translation.coachPrecheck.parallelizablePrompt.caption	This draft looks like several independent tasks
translation.coachPrecheck.parallelizablePrompt.description	The prompt contains independent tasks that can run at the same time. Devin suggests splitting them into parallel sessions so they finish faster.
translation.coachPrecheck.parallelizablePrompt.label	Parallelizable tasks
translation.coachPrecheck.parallelizablePrompt.recommendation	Run independent tasks in parallel child sessions
translation.coachPrecheck.send	Send
translation.coachPrecheck.unrelatedFollowupNewSession.caption	This task looks unrelated to the current session
translation.coachPrecheck.unrelatedFollowupNewSession.description	In a large session, the prompt asks for a new PR unrelated to the work done so far. Devin suggests doing it in a new session instead.
translation.coachPrecheck.unrelatedFollowupNewSession.label	Unrelated follow-up
translation.coachPrecheck.unrelatedFollowupNewSession.recommendation	Start a new session so a fresh task gets a clean context
translation.coachPrecheck.useCodeScan.caption	This looks codebase-wide. A Code Scan may fit better
translation.coachPrecheck.useCodeScan.description	The prompt asks Devin to find, audit, or report every instance of something across a whole codebase. Devin suggests running a Code Scan, which analyzes entire repositories in parallel and tracks each finding.
translation.coachPrecheck.useCodeScan.label	Codebase-wide task
translation.coachPrecheck.useCodeScan.recommendation	Run a Code Scan to find every instance across whole repositories and track each finding
